{"type": "tool_result", "toolName": "wren_run_sql", "toolCallId": "call_00_3eMH9MImPVylXEpnPbwr5434", "requestId": "479eca4c-1228-4d53-bd91-104928a5ab87", "runId": "620afd35-ea5", "seq": 122, "toolResult": "\"## wren 语义查询结果\\n\\n**知识库：** wren-gap-live-20261006-233059（group_id: `73b26360-df5c-497e-9137-bdfe7f50df67`）\\n\\n**查询问题：** 商品业务键 product_code 是否唯一？列出出现次数大于1的重复编码\\n\\n**SQL 语句：**\\n```sql\\nSELECT product_code, COUNT(*) AS cnt FROM product GROUP BY product_code HAVING COUNT(*) > 1 ORDER BY cnt DESC, product_code\\n```\\n\\n**查询结果：**\\n\\n| product_code | cnt |\\n|---|---|\\n| P2 | 2 |\\n\\n**数据文件：** data/3c1bb2cbe176.csv（1 行 × 2 列；run_python 中 pd.read_csv('data/3c1bb2cbe176.csv') 读取）\\n\""}
{"type": "tool_result", "toolName": "wren_run_sql", "toolCallId": "call_01_FryKXVhLXHBnLtmh9bA46400", "requestId": "479eca4c-1228-4d53-bd91-104928a5ab87", "runId": "620afd35-ea5", "seq": 123, "toolResult": "\"## wren 语义查询结果\\n\\n**知识库：** wren-gap-live-20261006-233059（group_id: `73b26360-df5c-497e-9137-bdfe7f50df67`）\\n\\n**查询问题：** 商品表总行数、product_code 去重数、行ID 去重数\\n\\n**SQL 语句：**\\n```sql\\nSELECT COUNT(*) AS total_rows, COUNT(DISTINCT product_code) AS distinct_codes, COUNT(DISTINCT product_row_id) AS distinct_row_ids FROM product\\n```\\n\\n**查询结果：**\\n\\n| total_rows | distinct_codes | distinct_row_ids |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| 4 | 3 | 4 |\\n\\n**数据文件：** data/f404e660a84b.csv（1 行 × 3 列；run_python 中 pd.read_csv('data/f404e660a84b.csv') 读取）\\n\""}
